{"seq":2,"slug":"rum-platforms","title":"RUM 平台选型与对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/analysis/rum-platforms","wordCount":1025,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"rum-平台选型与对比\">RUM 平台选型与对比</h1><p>CrUX 提供了 Google 视角的聚合性能数据，但当你需要逐会话归因、跨浏览器覆盖、实时告警和后端 Trace 关联时，商业 Real User Monitoring（RUM）平台不可替代。2026 年 RUM 市场已高度成熟，核心玩家各有所长。选型时最关键的判断不是功能清单最长的那个，而是最贴合你团队工作流的那个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RUM 平台的本质是一个数据管线：浏览器端轻量 SDK 采集性能/错误/行为数据 → 传输到后端 → 聚合/关联/存储 → 通过 Dashboard/Alert/API 暴露给工程团队。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Browser SDK&lt;br/&gt;~10-30KB] --&gt; B[数据传输&lt;br/&gt;beacon/fetch]&#10;    B --&gt; C[后端管线&lt;br/&gt;摄入/采样/聚合]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;指标可视化]&#10;    C --&gt; E[Alerting&lt;br/&gt;阈值/异常检测]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Session Replay&lt;br/&gt;行为回放]&#10;    C --&gt; G[APM 关联&lt;br/&gt;前后端 Trace]\">graph LR\n    A[Browser SDK&lt;br/&gt;~10-30KB] --&gt; B[数据传输&lt;br/&gt;beacon/fetch]\n    B --&gt; C[后端管线&lt;br/&gt;摄入/采样/聚合]\n    C --&gt; D[Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;指标可视化]\n    C --&gt; E[Alerting&lt;br/&gt;阈值/异常检测]\n    C --&gt; F[Session Replay&lt;br/&gt;行为回放]\n    C --&gt; G[APM 关联&lt;br/&gt;前后端 Trace]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>权重参考</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Core Web Vitals 精度</td>\n<td>LCP/INP/CLS 采集是否对齐 web-vitals 规范</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPA 支持</td>\n<td>软导航检测、路由变更追踪</td>\n<td>高（SPA 团队）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因深度</td>\n<td>能否从指标 → 元素 → 脚本 → 代码行</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前后端关联</td>\n<td>RUM session 能否直连后端 APM trace</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Session Replay</td>\n<td>行为回放质量、隐私控制</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样灵活度</td>\n<td>头采样/尾采样/条件采样</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定价模型</td>\n<td>按 session/event/数据量/席位</td>\n<td>关键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自托管能力</td>\n<td>数据主权、合规要求</td>\n<td>因团队而异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"主流平台对比\">主流平台对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>核心优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n<th>定价模型</th>\n<th>适合团队</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Sentry</strong></td>\n<td>错误追踪最强 + 性能一体 + Session Replay + 开发者体验</td>\n<td>APM/基础设施弱</td>\n<td>按 event 量</td>\n<td>前端为主的中小团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Datadog RUM</strong></td>\n<td>全栈关联（RUM→APM→Infra→Log）、Browser Profiler(2026 新)</td>\n<td>贵、学习曲线</td>\n<td>按 session 量</td>\n<td>已用 Datadog APM 的大团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Grafana Faro</strong></td>\n<td>开源自托管、与 Grafana 生态深度集成</td>\n<td>功能不如商业平台丰富</td>\n<td>免费（自托管成本）</td>\n<td>有基础设施能力 + 数据主权要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>New Relic</strong></td>\n<td>全栈 + 100GB/月免费额</td>\n<td>界面复杂、SPA 支持一般</td>\n<td>按数据摄入量</td>\n<td>预算有限但需全栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>SpeedCurve</strong></td>\n<td>性能专精、RUM+Synthetic 一体</td>\n<td>无错误追踪、无 APM</td>\n<td>按站点数</td>\n<td>专注性能的小型团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Elastic Observability</strong></td>\n<td>自托管 + 全栈 + 开源核心</td>\n<td>运维复杂</td>\n<td>按节点/数据量</td>\n<td>已有 ELK 栈的团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sentry-性能监控详解\">Sentry 性能监控详解</h2><p>Sentry 从错误追踪起家，2020 年扩展到性能监控。其独特优势是将错误和性能数据在<strong>同一个会话上下文</strong>中呈现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import * as Sentry from &#39;@sentry/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;Sentry.init({&#10;  dsn: &#39;https://xxx@sentry.io/123&#39;,&#10;  integrations: [Sentry.browserTracingIntegration(), Sentry.replayIntegration()],&#10;  tracesSampleRate: 0.1, // 10% 性能数据采样&#10;  replaysSessionSampleRate: 0.01, // 1% 会话回放&#10;  replaysOnErrorSampleRate: 1.0, // 出错会话 100% 回放&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Sentry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@sentry/react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Sentry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dsn: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://xxx@sentry.io/123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  integrations: [Sentry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">browserTracingIntegration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), Sentry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replayIntegration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tracesSampleRate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 10% 性能数据采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  replaysSessionSampleRate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1% 会话回放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  replaysOnErrorSampleRate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 出错会话 100% 回放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Sentry 在 2026 年的差异化能力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从 INP 告警直接跳转到该交互的 Session Replay，看到用户点了什么、页面怎么响应的</li>\n<li>Source map 集成成熟（Webpack/Vite/Next.js 一键配置），stack trace 精确到源码行</li>\n<li>Web Vitals 仪表板将 LCP/INP/CLS 与 Release 版本关联，一眼看出哪次发布引入了回归</li>\n<li>开发者体验好：GitHub 关联、IDE 深度链接、PR 级别的 issue 追踪</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"datadog-rum-详解\">Datadog RUM 详解</h2><p>Datadog 的杀手锏是<strong>全栈关联</strong>——前端慢不一定是前端的问题，可能是后端 API 超时、数据库慢查询或 CDN 缓存未命中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { datadogRum } from &#39;@datadog/browser-rum&#39;;&#10;&#10;datadogRum.init({&#10;  applicationId: &#39;app-id&#39;,&#10;  clientToken: &#39;pub-token&#39;,&#10;  site: &#39;datadoghq.com&#39;,&#10;  service: &#39;my-web-app&#39;,&#10;  env: &#39;production&#39;,&#10;  version: &#39;1.2.3&#39;,&#10;  sessionSampleRate: 100,&#10;  sessionReplaySampleRate: 20,&#10;  trackUserInteractions: true,&#10;  trackResources: true,&#10;  trackLongTasks: true,&#10;  defaultPrivacyLevel: &#39;mask-user-input&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { datadogRum } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@datadog/browser-rum'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">datadogRum.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  applicationId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'app-id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  clientToken: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pub-token'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  site: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'datadoghq.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  service: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'my-web-app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  env: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'production'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.2.3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sessionSampleRate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sessionReplaySampleRate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trackUserInteractions: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trackResources: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trackLongTasks: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  defaultPrivacyLevel: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mask-user-input'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>2026 年 DASH 大会新发布的 <strong>Browser Profiler</strong>（Public Preview）将方法级 stack frame 与 RUM 会话直接关联——从 INP 指标一路下钻到具体 JavaScript 函数耗时，无需手动 profiling。</p>\n<h2 id=\"grafana-faro-开源方案\">Grafana Faro 开源方案</h2><p>对数据主权有要求或希望避免商业锁定的团队，Grafana Faro 是 2026 年最成熟的开源 RUM 选择：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { initializeFaro } from &#39;@grafana/faro-web-sdk&#39;;&#10;import { TracingInstrumentation } from &#39;@grafana/faro-web-tracing&#39;;&#10;&#10;initializeFaro({&#10;  url: &#39;https://your-grafana-instance/collect&#39;,&#10;  app: { name: &#39;my-app&#39;, version: &#39;1.0.0&#39; },&#10;  instrumentations: [new TracingInstrumentation()],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { initializeFaro } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@grafana/faro-web-sdk'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { TracingInstrumentation } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@grafana/faro-web-tracing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">initializeFaro</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://your-grafana-instance/collect'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  app: { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'my-app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, version: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instrumentations: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TracingInstrumentation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Faro 的数据直接流入 Grafana Tempo（Trace）、Loki（Log）、Mimir（Metrics），通过 Grafana Dashboard 统一可视化。缺点是需要自行维护采集后端和存储基础设施。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策树\">选型决策树</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[选型起点] --&gt; B{已有 Datadog APM?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[Datadog RUM&lt;br/&gt;全栈关联最强]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{数据主权要求?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E{有基础设施能力?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[Grafana Faro&lt;br/&gt;开源自托管]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[Elastic Cloud&lt;br/&gt;托管的开源栈]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| H{团队规模?}&#10;    H --&gt;|&lt; 50 工程师| I[Sentry&lt;br/&gt;性价比 + 开发者体验]&#10;    H --&gt;|&gt; 50 工程师| J{预算充裕?}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| C&#10;    J --&gt;|否| K[New Relic&lt;br/&gt;100GB 免费额度]\">graph TD\n    A[选型起点] --&gt; B{已有 Datadog APM?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[Datadog RUM&lt;br/&gt;全栈关联最强]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{数据主权要求?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E{有基础设施能力?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[Grafana Faro&lt;br/&gt;开源自托管]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[Elastic Cloud&lt;br/&gt;托管的开源栈]\n    D --&gt;|否| H{团队规模?}\n    H --&gt;|&lt; 50 工程师| I[Sentry&lt;br/&gt;性价比 + 开发者体验]\n    H --&gt;|&gt; 50 工程师| J{预算充裕?}\n    J --&gt;|是| C\n    J --&gt;|否| K[New Relic&lt;br/&gt;100GB 免费额度]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RUM 平台补充 CrUX 无法覆盖的实时性、会话级上下文和跨浏览器数据</li>\n<li>Sentry 适合前端为主的团队（错误+性能+回放一体）</li>\n<li>Datadog RUM 适合已有 Datadog 全栈的大团队（前后端关联无敌）</li>\n<li>Grafana Faro 适合有基础设施能力且重视数据主权的团队</li>\n<li>选型核心不是功能清单，而是与团队现有工作流的契合度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"performance-debugging-workflow\">性能调试工作流</a>——拿到 RUM 数据后如何系统地定位根因</li>\n<li><a href=\"../frontend-observability/observability-platforms/sentry-platform\">前端可观测性 — Sentry 平台</a>——Sentry 在更广义可观测性场景下的完整能力</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RUM 平台选型与对比","id":"rum-平台选型与对比"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"主流平台对比","id":"主流平台对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Sentry 性能监控详解","id":"sentry-性能监控详解"},{"level":2,"text":"Datadog RUM 详解","id":"datadog-rum-详解"},{"level":2,"text":"Grafana Faro 开源方案","id":"grafana-faro-开源方案"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策树","id":"选型决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"CrUX 真实用户数据解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/analysis/crux-field-data"},"next":{"title":"性能调试工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/analysis/performance-debugging-workflow"}}